t-patient/genomics function for this. I should consider the structure I need for the records to ensure everything works smoothly. Let's go ahead and execute this task! I’m curious to see what information we’ll gather and how it can help in completing the request effectively.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_BZzesQO1AUrAwboM0ZSJ3z3S|fc_057202a153273ebf0169ef6dea9b1081919f8cad25eebf5247","name":"update_plan","arguments":{"plan":[{"step":"Fetch patient KLM data for PT-9921","status":"in_progress"},{"step":"Synthesize uploaded records into clinical picture","status":"pending"},{"step":"Ask first recommended follow-up question","status":"pending"}]},"partialJson":"{\"plan\":[{\"step\":\"Fetch patient KLM data for PT-9921\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"step\":\"Synthesize uploaded records into clinical picture\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"step\":\"Ask first recommended follow-up question\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1531,"output":90,"cacheRead":13824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15445,"cost":{"input":0.0038275,"output":0.00135,"cacheRead":0.003456,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.008633499999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777298916663,"responseId":"resp_057202a153273ebf0169ef6de557cc8191bc0796cc56df1efb"}}
