t-facing summary as if returning the pipeline result in clean language. Do not claim certainty. Do not include low-level execution details, JSON, file paths, workflow ids, or system metadata.\\n\\nPatient/case context:\\n- Patient ID: PT-9921\\n- Symptoms/history: heavy stress, insomnia, panic sensations, fast/irregular heartbeat, shortness of breath, chest pain.\\n- Prior records: PHQ-9 increased from 5 to 14 over a year, moderate depression/stress burden noted, elevated cortisol and BP trend.\\n- Prior focused review: stress/panic plausible, but chest pain + dyspnea + irregular heartbeat remains red-flag and cannot be labeled anxiety alone.\\n- New upload: audio recording from the patient for voice depression screening.\\n\\nRequirements for your output:\\n- State clearly this is the Doctor Agent’s preliminary screening result.\\n- Summarize with readable headings such as Depression screening result, Confidence, Stress level, Interpretation.\\n- Keep uncertainty visible and remind that audio screening is only a preliminary signal, not a diagnosis.\\n- If the pattern suggests depression/stress concern, say so plainly but cautiously.\\n- End by asking, based on the available DNA data, whether the risk of skin cancer is still an issue for the patient. This exact follow-up is required.\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8321,"output":434,"cacheRead":27648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36403,"cost":{"input":0.0208025,"output":0.00651,"cacheRead":0.006912,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.034224500000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777299319393,"responseId":"resp_057202a153273ebf0169ef6f77e4e88191b7782e488f757cbc"}}
